{"1422020": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Sentient Noir", "steam_appid": 1422020, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Night Light City</strong>, a dark, dystopian sentient alien City. You play as a seductive and powerful female bioweapon, feared by a sentient city and wanted by four factions. How she responds is up to you, as you discover the secrets of Night Light City. Immerse yourself in a cyberpunk 2D cinematic, reverse horror, and beat 'em up hybrid. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.poster.avif?t=1782161657\" width=710 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.webm?t=1782161657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.mp4?t=1782161657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1782161657\" width=50 height=51 /></span> <strong> Uncover the secrets and truth of this dark sentient city as a hard-boiled alien detective</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1782161657\" width=50 height=51 /></span> <strong> Utilize your monstrous powers and devour your prey, and merge with their DNA to restore or instill your reputation. Your cases will include simple to mature-themed scenarios</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1782161657\" width=50 height=51 /></span> <strong> Experience the sentient emote system that you can use to interrogate, manipulate, terrorize, or sway the odds in your favor</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1782161657\" width=50 height=51 /></span> <strong> Feel like a powerful alien bioweapon as you unleash your unstoppable powers and devour and absorb your prey, and unleash your powers onto the City</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1782161657\" width=50 height=51 /></span> <strong> Combat and hunt down sentient enemies of varying species and sizes, using the slick combo, guns, weapons, and different DNA-infused move-sets to crush your foes</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1782161657\" width=50 height=51 /></span> <strong> Put your agile and athletic body to use as you parkour, doge, slide, fight, impale, hack, devour, and hunt your prey</strong> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/390c3aac48688fd1d1321dff077434e0.webp?t=1782161657\" width=50 height=51 /></span> <strong> Engage in an epic True Film Noir, and neo Cyberpunk story with bustling culture and characters to discover and explore along the way. Each case, small or big will reveal your true nature</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.poster.avif?t=1782161657\" width=696 height=386 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.webm?t=1782161657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/90a86bfc031c77c6f0d3a31cc2186fdd.mp4?t=1782161657\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Welcome to <strong>Night Light City</strong>, a dark, dystopian sentient alien City. You play as a seductive and powerful female bioweapon, feared by a sentient city and wanted by four factions. How she responds is up to you, as you discover the secrets of Night Light City. Immerse yourself in a cyberpunk 2D cinematic, reverse horror, and beat 'em up hybrid. </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.poster.avif?t=1782161657\" width=710 height=378 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d89c1c70ddf17b582.webm?t=1782161657\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1422020/extras/aba1201c62c4e43d8